  "changelog": "Initial release of the Alibaba Cloud Elasticsearch Log Config Generator.\n\n- Generates a single log collection configuration file for Alibaba Cloud Elasticsearch or self-managed Elasticsearch.\n- Supports OpenTelemetry Collector (otelcol-contrib) and Elastic Beats / Filebeat as technology stacks.\n- Handles log inputs from files, HTTP/webhook (OTLP), or Kafka topics.\n- Enforces strict constraints: never mixes stacks, outputs only to Elasticsearch, and never inlines secrets.\n- References comprehensive local documentation for each supported component and feature.",
